# Build context for .kamal/Dockerfile. Allow-list: everything is excluded, then only what the image
# builds from is let back in, so the context stays small and never carries .kamal/secrets.
*

!.kamal/nginx.conf

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json

!libs
!apps/demo
!apps/site/out

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
